    "title": "Global Wildlife Center has several reasons to celebrate the month of June - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thanh Truong ,\n7 hours ago FOLSOM, La (WVUE) - Some of the scenes at Global Wildlife Center may look they’re from the Serengeti or South America, but they’re from Folsom in St. Tammany Parish. From towering giraffes to the more grounded bison, over 3,000 animals are estimated to be living at Global Wildlife Center, which has several reasons to celebrate this month. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
